{"metadata":{"name":"Sunan Ibn Majah","name_native":"سنن ابن ماجه","section":{"33":"Etiquette"},"section_detail":{"33":{"hadithnumber_first":3657,"hadithnumber_last":3826,"arabicnumber_first":3657,"arabicnumber_last":3826,"name_native":"كتاب الأدب"}}},"hadiths":[{"hadithnumber":3722,"arabicnumber":3722,"text":"حدثنا ابو بكر بن ابي شيبة، حدثنا زيد بن الحباب، عن ابي المنيب، عن ابن بريدة، عن ابيه، ان النبي صلى الله عليه وسلم نهى ان يقعد بين الظل والشمس","grades":[{"name":"Al-Albani","grade":"Sahih"},{"name":"Muhammad Fouad Abd al-Baqi","grade":"Sahih"},{"name":"Shuaib Al Arnaut","grade":"Hasan Lighairihi"},{"name":"Zubair Ali Zai","grade":"Isnaad Hasan"}],"reference":{"book":33,"hadith":66}}]}